  stem:"If \"ch1\" is a channel object created in \"channel\" table with primary key 1, then the correct way(s) of creating a video object \"vid1\" in the video table that belongs to \"ch1\" object is/are (let \"name\" of the video be \"Intro to Python\")",options:["```\n>>> vid1 = Video (name = \"Intro to Python\", channel = ch1)\n>>> db.session.add(vid1)\n>>> db.session.commit()\n\n\n```", "```\n>>> vid1 = Video (name = \"Intro to Python\", channel = 1)\n>>> db.session.add(vid1)\n>>> db.session.commit()\n\n\n```", "```\n>>> vid1 = Video(name = \"Intro to Python\", playlist = ch1)\n>>> db.session.add(vid1)\n>>> db.session.commit()\n\n\n```", "```\n>>> vid1 = Video(name = \"Intro to Python\", playlist = 1)\n>>> db.session.add(vid1)\n>>> db.session.commit()\n\n\n```"],key:["B","C"],
